&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE local-display-fields V-table-Win 
PROCEDURE local-display-fields :
/*------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Purpose:     Override standard ADM method
  Notes:       
------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

  /* Code placed here will execute PRIOR to standard behavior. */

  /* Dispatch standard ADM method.                             */
  RUN dispatch IN THIS-PROCEDURE ( INPUT 'display-fields':U ) .

  /* Code placed here will execute AFTER standard behavior.    */

  ASSIGN v-cod-eqpto = bc-eqpto.cod-eqpto:SCREEN-VALUE IN FRAME {&FRAME-NAME}.

   /* Busca Descri‡Æo */
   FIND FIRST bc-tip-eqpto
        WHERE bc-tip-eqpto.cod-tip-eqpto = bc-eqpto.cod-tip-eqpto:SCREEN-VALUE IN FRAME {&FRAME-NAME}
        NO-LOCK NO-ERROR.
   IF AVAIL bc-tip-eqpto THEN
       ASSIGN f-des-tipo-equip:SCREEN-VALUE = bc-tip-eqpto.des-tip-eqpto.

END PROCEDURE.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME

